WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.199 --> 00:00:06.869
How to turn your idea into a business or a career.

00:00:06.869 --> 00:00:11.274
So, I got a great question from one of my YouTube viewers, ladraper99, who wrote in to say:

00:00:11.274 --> 00:00:15.921
"Hi, Evan. Hope all is well. I have a question. I work full time at a company, but it's not doing something

00:00:15.921 --> 00:00:21.065
"I´m passionate about. My passion that gives me great joy is encouraging others and talking to them

00:00:21.065 --> 00:00:22.608
"about their issues.

00:00:22.608 --> 00:00:25.113
"How can I turn this into a business and/or career?"

00:00:25.113 --> 00:00:27.983
This is a great question and I really feel for you.

00:00:27.983 --> 00:00:31.899
It sucks to wake up every day and go to a job that you hate!

00:00:31.899 --> 00:00:38.308
This is what 80% of North America does. They wake up and they go to a job that they're not passionate about,

00:00:38.308 --> 00:00:43.245
that they hate doing, so that they could come home, leave work at 5 o'clock and they're living for

00:00:43.245 --> 00:00:45.298
the evenings and weekends.

00:00:45.298 --> 00:00:47.313
For me, that's not a way to live.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:53.536
And I get that it's hard, it's hard leaving that stability; but if it's something that you're not passionate about it...

00:00:53.536 --> 00:00:57.904
I don't get how people can live and not do things that they're passionate about.

00:00:57.904 --> 00:01:02.847
Anyways... so, congratulations on having the courage here to want to step outside,

00:01:02.847 --> 00:01:07.326
do something a little different that might be scary, that might be risky, because you're passionate about it.

00:01:07.326 --> 00:01:08.868
It's important.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.330
How do you follow this up?

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:11.871
So, my advice for you is:

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.705
1. Get specific.

00:01:13.705 --> 00:01:15.572
You need to know WHO you're helping.

00:01:15.572 --> 00:01:17.389
You want to help people with their issues?

00:01:17.389 --> 00:01:19.834
Everybody has issues! Right? Everybody!

00:01:19.834 --> 00:01:22.580
There's nobody in the world who doesn't have issues.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.575
So, who do you want to help? Right?

00:01:24.575 --> 00:01:27.698
What kinds of people do you want to help? Get specific and define it.

00:01:27.698 --> 00:01:31.995
Do you want to help kids? Do you want to help people who are going through marital problems?

00:01:31.995 --> 00:01:36.187
Do you want to help entrepreneurs starting up? Do you want to help people on a charitable mission?

00:01:36.187 --> 00:01:39.116
Like, who do you want to help? Get specific.

00:01:39.116 --> 00:01:41.940
And maybe you already know this, maybe you know and that helps.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:44.966
But it's not being communicated, right? You didn't tell me.

00:01:44.966 --> 00:01:47.374
Or maybe you don't know and you need to get some clarity.

00:01:47.374 --> 00:01:51.713
So, figure that out. You have to figure out, be specific: who do you want to help?

00:01:51.713 --> 00:01:56.536
Second thing is, do you want to be an entrepreneur or do you want to just have a career?

00:01:56.536 --> 00:02:00.963
And there's nothing wrong with having a career that fulfills you, that makes you happy,

00:02:00.963 --> 00:02:05.157
that gives you your passion. You don't have to be an entrepreneur.

00:02:05.157 --> 00:02:10.173
As much as I love entrepreneurs and helping people becoming their own business owner,

00:02:10.173 --> 00:02:12.033
it doesn't have to be that way. You know?

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:15.215
If you don't have the mindset to be an entrepreneur, don't be an entrepreneur.

00:02:15.215 --> 00:02:19.517
I have the Zhuge mindset test that helps people figure out if they're meant to be an entrepreneur or not,

00:02:19.517 --> 00:02:21.411
if you have that right mindset.

00:02:21.411 --> 00:02:25.923
And if it's not for you, that's great! Like, it's good to know that.

00:02:25.923 --> 00:02:31.623
You can get whatever fulfillment you have potentially from a career, if you're not meant

00:02:31.623 --> 00:02:33.096
to be an entrepreneur.

00:02:33.096 --> 00:02:35.221
So, you're thinking about helping people, so... you know?

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:38.625
Do you want to be a guidance counselor? Do you want to be a marriage counselor?

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:41.318
Do you want to be a psychologist? Right?

00:02:41.318 --> 00:02:43.780
There's tons of opportunities, there are tons of...

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:48.699
traditional paths that you can take, without having to launch your own company,

00:02:48.699 --> 00:02:50.984
that might make you feel passionate.

00:02:50.984 --> 00:02:56.487
So you've got to figure out: do you want a career? Do you want to fit into this structure and this system?

00:02:56.487 --> 00:02:59.388
Or do you want to launch your own company? Because it's 2 different paths.

00:02:59.388 --> 00:03:02.400
And the third thing is: get started. Ok?

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:09.304
You don't need to go quit your job and have, you know, no income coming in and, you know, burn the boats

00:03:09.304 --> 00:03:11.230
and go and try this new thing.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:15.437
Start part-time, start small. Especially if you don't know who you want to help.

00:03:15.437 --> 00:03:20.382
Just start either volunteering, get a part-time job, help people on the side;

00:03:20.382 --> 00:03:26.853
but explore! Do something every week that you're spending some time to explore yourself,

00:03:26.853 --> 00:03:30.140
explore your passion and see who you really love helping out.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:34.593
It may be volunteering part-time at a school and being a part-time guidance counselor.

00:03:34.593 --> 00:03:40.260
Or helping some people, you know, volunteering again or taking a part-time job at psychology,

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:44.093
you know, with a psychologist who's helping people work through their issues. Right?

00:03:44.093 --> 00:03:49.442
Start! Because you're learning. And there are going to be some opportunities that you go to and you'll be:

00:03:49.442 --> 00:03:54.138
"You know? That's great, but it's not really for me."

00:03:54.138 --> 00:04:01.419
And there will be one that you go to and you'll say: "Wow! I want to do this! I want to do this more!"

00:04:01.419 --> 00:04:06.324
And that's when you know that you've found your passion. Right?

00:04:06.324 --> 00:04:09.605
That's how you know. You want to be like THAT person and you want to be in THIS industry.

00:04:09.605 --> 00:04:13.703
And it could be as a job or it could be starting your own company, but when you experience it,

00:04:13.703 --> 00:04:18.700
you get that feeling that makes you come alive, you KNOW that you've got to keep doing this!

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:22.761
If you look at famous entrepreneurs, look at how they got started, you look at WHY they got started,

00:04:22.761 --> 00:04:27.305
because they got that high. Right? They LOVE what they do, it's not just about making money,

00:04:27.305 --> 00:04:31.387
they truly, deeply, passionately love what they do. So you've got to find that.

00:04:31.387 --> 00:04:36.557
You've got to find what it is that gets you so excited and it comes from trying. So don't...

00:04:36.557 --> 00:04:41.884
this is a great start, being frustrated with your current work, having a general sense of where you want to go,

00:04:41.884 --> 00:04:45.598
that's a great start. The difference, though, here is you need to act.

00:04:45.598 --> 00:04:52.352
And act part-time, small scale, but consistently. Something every single week that you are doing

00:04:52.352 --> 00:04:58.328
to explore this passion of yours until you find the thing that makes you come alive and say:

00:04:58.328 --> 00:04:59.919
"I need to go do this!"

00:04:59.919 --> 00:05:02.140
When you find that...

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:04.628
then you know you're on the right path.

00:05:04.628 --> 00:05:06.154
Believe!

00:05:06.154 --> 00:05:08.869
For those of you watching, I'd love to hear what you have to think.

00:05:08.869 --> 00:05:14.001
Let me know how you've broken out of the 9-5 job or how you've found your passion.

00:05:14.001 --> 00:05:18.657
Leave it in the comments below, I'd love to hear your story because it will help inspire other people as well.

00:05:18.657 --> 00:05:21.809
Give it a thumbs up if you liked this video, makes me want to do more for you.

00:05:21.809 --> 00:05:24.785
And click on my face to subscribe to the channel to see more videos like this.

00:05:24.785 --> 00:05:27.097
Thank you so much! I'll see you soon.

